      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, hinakeŋenu kuyamba cheliluwu ankakulula jetuku; adiŋi mwishina devu wejima wawu; ahitili mukaluŋalwiji wejima wawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayipapatishili mudi Mosi nimwivu nimukaluŋalwiji wejima wawu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyuma yakutalilahu etu kulonda tubuli kufwila yuma yatama yafwililuwu wena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwikala akwakupesha, neyi chapesheluwu wena amakwawuku; neyi chanasonekuwu nawu, Antu ashakamini nakudya nakunwa, hiyakunyamoka nakuhema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi twila wuvumbi neyi cheliluwu wena amakwawuku; hiyakufwa makombakaji makumi ayedi namakombakaji asatu ifuku dawu dimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi tumweseka Mwanta neyi chamwesekeluwu wena amakwawuku; hiyakuyijilumuna kudi atupela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mutoba neyi chatobeluwu wena amakwawuku; hiyakuyijilumuna kudi mukwakujilumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yumiyi dinu yayishikeneni wena kulonda etu tutaliluhu; ayisonekeli kulonda kutukonkomwena, etu tudi kunu kunsa yanyaka yamakonu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi yowu natoŋojoki nindi nemani, ababali kuchina kudimbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikunayiwani kweseka kwabulaŋa kutweshawu antu ejimaku; ilaŋa Nzambi washinshika, hakwiteja kuyeseka chabadika muŊovu jenuku; chakuyesekawu wukubuzilaku njila yakupulukila, kulonda mutweshi kukakela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu akwetu twakeŋa a, temukenu kupesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinahoshaŋa nanenu nelaŋa nami muyakwamaana; shinshikenu munukuhosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ilu lupasa lwankisu lutwakisulana, hikutiyaloŋana mumashi aKristu hamu. Dinkendi idi ditwahumunaŋa, hikutiyaloŋana mumujimba waKristu hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela tunekali amavulu, tudi dinkendi dimu, tudi mujimba wumu; Muloŋa wejima wetu twatambulana dinkendi dimu, hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu chelaŋawu aIsarela kumuchidi wawu. Wena adyaloŋa yimuna yaketulaŋawu hamu nakameŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuhosha namidi? Nami, chimuna chaketwilaŋawu akishi hichuma, tahindi? Hela mukishi hichuma chalala, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nehi, ami nami yimuna yaketulaŋawu ajentili aketwilaŋa ademoni, hiyamuketwilaŋa Nzambuku. Hinakeŋenu kutambula hamu nawademonuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himukutwesha kwila munwa mulupasa lwaMwanta, munwa nawa mulupasa lwawademonuku. Himukutwesha kwila mutambula kumesa yaMwanta, mutambula nawa kumesa yawademonuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tumutiyishi Mwanta mukawu, tahindi? Twamubadika Ŋovu, tahindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yonsu yaloŋa; ilaŋa yuma yi kwawu hiyakwashanaŋaku. Yuma yonsu yaloŋa, ilaŋa yuma yi kwawu hiyakoleshaŋaaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi muntu alonda yakudiwahisha nachu yomwenuku, chiŋa yakuwahisha nachu mukwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yalandishaŋawu kwakulandila yejima, kuminenu dakudya chakadi kwihula, kuchina kuyibayisha kudi chinleji chamuchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maseki ejima ambala aYehova, niyuma yalumbamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu wabula kwitiya wukuyitambika kuya nakudya nindi, neyi munakeŋi kuya, ilukenu dakudya yakuyitentekelawu yejima, chakadi kwihula, hansaŋu yachinleji chamuchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza neyi akuyileja kudi muntu wumu nindi, Iyi ayipeshela akishi; bayi mudyaku, hansaŋu yayenowu nakuleji, ninsaŋu yachinleji chamuchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nami chinleji chamukwenu chamuchima bayi cheyeyi awenuku. Muloŋanyi wakunsompeshelawu chuma chineteji nachinleji chamuntu wacheŋi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi natambulaŋa nakusakilila, Muloŋanyi wakuntenenawu chatama nachuma chinasakililaŋa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu, hela mukudya hela mukunwa, mumwelaŋa mwejima ilenu kulonda kulemesha Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwila chuma chakudimbwisha hela aYudeya, hela aHeleni, hela chipompelu chaNzambuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chochinatiyishaŋa ntu ejima kuwaha muyuma yejima, hinakeŋa kwami kudikwasha ami awenuku; chiŋa yowu kukwasha antu amavulu, kulonda ahandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
